      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "更多的能量呢？原来这是由于水分子之间的内聚力大于乙醚",
        "分子之间的内聚力的缘故."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**问题**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(1) 当液体蒸发时，分子飞出液面之外要做什么功？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(2) 如何解释液体蒸发时温度下降的现象？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(3) 怎样用实验表明液体蒸发时温度下降的现象？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(4) 在相同的条件下，一些种液体蒸发得快而另些种液",
        "体蒸发得慢. 如何解释这种现象？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**105. 蒸汽的凝结**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们已经谈到过，分子由蒸汽中迁移到液体中的现象叫",
        "做**凝结.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**蒸汽凝结时总是有能量释放出来.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "液体在某一温度下蒸发时吸收多少能量，则其蒸汽在相",
        "同的温度下凝结时就放出多少能量. 换个说法是，**凝结时所",
        "放出的热量总是等于汽化时所吸收的热量.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "水凝结的例子在自然界中是经常见到的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "夏季的夜晚，当气温变冷的时候就会有露出现. 这就",
        "是空气中的水蒸汽遇冷后附在青草、树叶上所形成的小水",
        "滴."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "云的形成也可以用蒸汽的凝结来解释. 水蒸汽升到高空",
        "后，由于那里的气温低，就结成许许多多极小的小水滴而形",
        "成云."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "*258*"
      ]
    }
